        "question": "Can I change plans or add seats during the term?",
        "answer": "Seats can generally be added at any point in the term, while reductions take effect at the annual renewal date. Moving users between plans depends on the agreement the subscription sits under, so confirm the mechanics before committing. Ask for a quotation if you need monthly or multi-year terms."
