        "answer": "Most small firms start with Business Standard because it includes installed desktop Office apps, a business mailbox, Teams and 1 TB of OneDrive. Choose Basic for staff who only need web and mobile apps, and Premium where personal phones read work mail or client data needs stronger protection."
